---
// Home hero animation (owner's design, "proline-animation.html", 15 Nov 2026): a car on charge in three
// scenes (home and office AC, workplace AC, commercial DC) that change every 10.5 s, with buttons to pick one.
// Ported to the site: classes and SVG ids carry an "ha-" prefix so they never clash with the rest of the page;
// layout follows the width of the box it sits in (container queries), not the window; site font and colours.
// Motion stops off-screen, when the tab is hidden, on Pause, and for visitors who ask for reduced motion.
